## How to Use a Skill in Cursor

1. Determine if a skill matches the current task (use table above)
2. Read the full skill file: `.agents-shared/skills/{skill-name}.skill.md`
3. Follow the procedure documented in the skill

## Sync Rule

When creating or modifying skill files:
- `.claude/skills/` and `.agents-shared/skills/` must stay identical
- Write the primary change first, then sync the copy
- `.claude/skills/` is NOT a fork — it is a mirror of `.agents-shared/skills/`
